# Database rules

- Schema source of truth: `backend/prisma/schema.prisma` documented in `docs/DATABASE_ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Maintain referential integrity, unique constraints (especially one vote per user per outing), and indexes for deadline/status queries.
- Prefer additive, safe migrations; never silently run destructive production resets.
- Preserve invariants: attendance ≠ votes; winner option belongs to same outing; Firebase UID = `users.id`.
- After every schema change in the same task: update `docs/DATABASE_ARCHITECTURE.md` (and business/system/user docs if rules or workflows change).
- Do not document obsolete enums (`upcoming`, `not_voted`) as current.
